@startuml F7.1-D02-criar-usuario
title F7.1-D02 — Criar usuário
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "IAMController" as Ctrl
participant "CreateUserUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Salvar usuário
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /admin/usuarios
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  senha temp + Argon2id;
  admin não vê senha
end note
UC -> Postgres: INSERT user\n+ audit_log\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Admin: usuário na tabela

@enduml
